key_decisions.rationale:
On all three valid sets:
- warm P2-P4 NtfF +0/+0/+0;
- accumulation +4/+5/+5, within b;
- P2 at exit+600 +1 to +3;
- WC leak tags within idle on every warm repeat.
This is what the fork decider's YES branch prescribes. Reversing it would mean an arm type that has to exist before the person's one-shot Restart.

